(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-91","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["小唐说包里有女儿的[[souvenir|纪念品]]，旧[[soviet|苏联的]]飞船图只是她画画的垫纸。高点[[space|空间]]狭窄，[[spaceship|宇宙飞船]]画盖着[[spanish|西班牙语的]]旧展单，[[sparrow|麻雀]]从架边飞开。程雾作为听音[[speaker|发言人]]，提醒负责人这不是她的结构[[speciality|专长]]。接人[[speed|速度]]由现场决定，我们只[[spell|拼清]]小唐报的姓名，别让他变成编号。他说自己也不是[[sportsman|运动员]]，脚在发麻。负责人答不需要运动员，照指令将身体留在稳处，余下由他们做。岸上没有掌声，只有灯光一次次确认他的手。","他女儿画的是[[springtime|春天]]，身旁却只有一块[[square|方形的]]高台。移动箱会[[squash|压住]]出口，他不能再[[squat|蹲下]]去取，一只[[squirrel|松鼠]]模型已经落水。眼前这个[[stage|阶段]]不用照顾模型。救援组检查[[stainless|不锈的]]旧扣，确认[[stair|梯级]]不能用，再搭专用[[stairway|梯道]]。小唐[[stammer|结巴地说]]自己怕拖累人，负责人把[[standard|标准]]说得简单：先回来。他不用替现场[[standardize|使标准化]]任何记录，也不用在[[statistical|统计的]]表里证明这次没有损失，人的回来本身就是此刻要完成的事。","避险点准备[[steak|肉排]]，但还不能让小唐吃。我怕潮会[[steal|偷走]]时间，[[steel|钢]]梁仍一[[step|步]]一步受牵动。厨房的[[stew|炖菜]]有人看着，一位做过[[stewardess|乘务员]]的志愿者照看伤者家属。老陈的[[stick|手杖]]还在铺子，疼痛使肩[[stiffen|僵硬]]，医生正在检查。我的[[stomach|胃]]空着，却想先握到他手。母亲坐在[[stone|石]]阶边的[[stool|凳子]]上等我，她没有来危险处，只在医疗点一[[storey|层]]门厅。她说汤可以等，先告诉她谁还没回来。我答小唐，把他的名字也说给她听。","一名[[stout|结实的]]救援员先上固定通道，让小唐[[straighten|伸直]]腿。平台如被困在[[strait|窘境]]，不能凭[[strength|力量]]硬拽。我们[[strictly|严格地]]留划线后，栏板再[[strike|撞击]]时，负责人[[strongly|坚定地]]叫暂停，重新核结构。会客室[[stuffy|闷热]]，贺青要求去车里，何警官不为[[subdue|压服]]他而多争，只安排陪同。原页角上[[subscript|下标]]仍有箱尾号，[[subsequently|随后]]可核；当下[[substantially|实质上]]要完成的，是让接人通道不用再跨那段不稳的梁。小唐的脚终于找到另一处固定点。","救援组终于[[succeed|成功]]把他带上岸，[[success|成功]]很安静，没人让他立刻站直拍照。小唐交回湿外衣，先问同事，得知二人都在便闭上眼休息。那张女儿画留在原包内，相关工程原件由另一组登记，私人纸不归我们。医生告诉我老陈右腕骨折，需要治疗和一段不能负重的恢复；这会影响他靠手吃饭，不是一枚可供讲述的英勇勋章。我把结果告诉程雾，她说有办法一起照看铺子，但不能替他许诺多久就好。我们将计划交给本人，不用一个好听结局强迫他马上不疼。","所有人已清点回岸，何警官给母亲发获准的平安确认，避免她只从网上听见怪异片段。现场继续封闭，危险货没有离港；原账安全，工程原页箱仍在高架，要等结构稳定后回收。老陈在床上让我别买贵水果，说住院费才是真的。我点头，他却握住我的左手问小唐到了没有。我说到了，三个人全到了。他终于放松手，闭眼睡下。下一章可以去接那只纸箱，前提是不会把另一名工作人员送回同样的高点；人已回来，不需要为了故事更漂亮再给谁增加一次伤。"],"en":["Tang's bag held his daughter's [[souvenir|souvenir]]. A [[soviet|Soviet]] ship image backed her drawing. With little [[space|space]], a [[spaceship|spaceship]] picture covered a [[spanish|Spanish]] form as a [[sparrow|sparrow]] flew away. Cheng's role as acoustic [[speaker|speaker]] was no structural [[speciality|speciality]]. Rescuers chose [[speed|speed]]; we would [[spell|spell]] names accurately. Tang was no [[sportsman|sportsman]] and his foot was numb. He needed no athletic ability, the leader said, only to follow instructions and remain steady. Lamps confirmed his hand without applause.","A [[springtime|springtime]] drawing contrasted with a [[square|square]] platform. Moving boxes might [[squash|squash]] the exit; he could not [[squat|squat]] for them. A [[squirrel|squirrel]] model fell into water. At this [[stage|stage]] models did not matter. Staff examined [[stainless|stainless]] clasps and rejected an old [[stair|stair]], preparing a dedicated [[stairway|stairway]]. Tang would [[stammer|stammer]] about delaying others. The [[standard|standard]] was return. He needed neither to [[standardize|standardize]] paperwork nor prove zero losses in a [[statistical|statistical]] table. Bringing a person back was the present task.","Shelter [[steak|steak]] was not yet available to him. I feared water would [[steal|steal]] time. [[steel|Steel]] beams moved [[step|step]] by step. Volunteers watched [[stew|stew]]; a former [[stewardess|stewardess]] helped families. Chen's [[stick|stick]] remained home while pain made shoulders [[stiffen|stiffen]]. My [[stomach|stomach]] was empty. Mother waited on a [[stool|stool]] beside a [[stone|stone]] step in the medical building's first [[storey|storey]], away from danger. Soup could wait, she said. Who remained? I gave her Tang's name, letting her worry concern a person rather than an anonymous count.","A [[stout|stout]] rescuer helped Tang [[straighten|straighten]] a leg. The platform's [[strait|strait]] demanded more than [[strength|strength]]. [[strictly|Strictly]] behind lines, we heard a rail [[strike|strike]] and a [[strongly|strongly]] issued pause for reassessment. In a [[stuffy|stuffy]] room, He Qing requested his car; officers arranged accompaniment without trying to [[subdue|subdue]] him through argument. A record [[subscript|subscript]] could be checked [[subsequently|subsequently]]. [[substantially|Substantially]], the immediate need was bypassing an unstable beam. Tang finally found another fixed support for his foot.","Rescuers would [[succeed|succeed]] in bringing him ashore. [[success|Success]] required no posed photograph. He asked about colleagues then rested. His daughter's drawing stayed private; engineers' originals were separately registered. Doctors confirmed Chen's fractured wrist required treatment and recovery without loads, affecting his livelihood rather than decorating a hero story. Cheng proposed shared help at the shop, promising no invented recovery time. We would discuss plans with him instead of forcing pain into an attractive ending.","All people were ashore. Mother received an authorized safety confirmation. Cargo remained stopped, accounts safe, engineering pages still awaiting structural stabilization. Chen warned me to save money for real hospital costs, not expensive fruit. Gripping my left hand, he asked about Tang. All three were back, I said. He relaxed and slept. Next we could retrieve paper only without creating another stranded worker. Nobody needed another injury to make a story look more complete."]});
